---
interface Props { data?: any }
const { data } = Astro.props;
---
<div class="mockup-ritmo-pace" set:html={`<section class="hero"><div class="shell hero-grid"><div><div class="crumb">Salud / Ritmo y pace</div><div class="eyebrow">Ritmo, velocidad y parciales</div><h1>Convertí una marca en un ritmo que puedas correr.</h1><p class="lede">Ingresá distancia y tiempo para obtener pace, velocidad, parciales y proyecciones comparables.</p><div class="chips"><span class="chip">min:seg por km</span><span class="chip">km/h</span><span class="chip">Proyección de carrera</span></div></div><div class="art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="orb"></div><div class="card-art"><div class="art-tag">RITMO PROMEDIO</div><div class="art-value" id="heroValue">5:30/km</div><div class="art-line"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="shell"><div class="head"><div class="eyebrow">Elegí una distancia o cargá la tuya</div><h2>Cuatro referencias siempre visibles</h2><p>Cada botón carga una marca inicial; después podés editar cualquier dato.</p></div><div class="cases"><button class="case" data-case="0"><b>5 kilómetros</b><small>Ideal para medir velocidad y progreso reciente.</small></button><button class="case active" data-case="1"><b>10 kilómetros</b><small>Equilibra velocidad y resistencia.</small></button><button class="case" data-case="2"><b>Media maratón</b><small>21,097 km con mayor peso de la resistencia.</small></button><button class="case" data-case="3"><b>Maratón</b><small>42,195 km: la proyección exige entrenamiento específico.</small></button></div><div class="calc"><div class="panel"><h3>Tu marca</h3><p class="intro" id="caseIntro">Usá una carrera o entrenamiento continuo representativo.</p><div class="fields"><div class="field full"><label for="distance">Distancia recorrida (km)</label><input id="distance" type="number" min="0.1" step="0.001" value="10"></div><div class="field"><label for="hours">Horas</label><input id="hours" type="number" min="0" step="1" value="0"></div><div class="field"><label for="minutes">Minutos</label><input id="minutes" type="number" min="0" max="59" step="1" value="55"></div><div class="field"><label for="seconds">Segundos</label><input id="seconds" type="number" min="0" max="59" step="1" value="0"></div><div class="field"><label for="unit">Unidad del ritmo</label><select id="unit"><option value="km">min/km</option><option value="mile">min/milla</option></select></div></div><div class="buttons"><button class="primary" id="calculate">Actualizar ritmo</button><button class="secondary" id="reset">Reiniciar</button></div></div><div class="panel result" aria-live="polite"><div class="res-top"><div><div class="label">Ritmo promedio</div><div class="amount" id="amount">—</div></div><span class="pill" id="scenario">10 kilómetros</span></div><p class="summary" id="summary"></p><div class="metrics"><div class="metric"><span>Velocidad media</span><strong id="m1">—</strong></div><div class="metric"><span>Parcial de 400 m</span><strong id="m2">—</strong></div><div class="metric"><span>Proyección 5K</span><strong id="m3">—</strong></div><div class="metric"><span>Proyección 10K</span><strong id="m4">—</strong></div></div><div class="progress"><i id="bar"></i></div><div class="note" id="note">Las proyecciones usan una curva de resistencia: no reemplazan entrenamiento específico, clima ni desnivel.</div></div></div></div></section><section class="section support"><div class="shell"><div class="head"><div class="eyebrow">Cómo usar el pace</div><h2>Un promedio no cuenta toda la carrera</h2></div><div class="support-grid"><article class="support-card"><span>SALIDA</span><h3>Empezá controlado</h3><p>Los primeros parciales deberían sentirse sostenibles; recuperar una salida demasiado rápida suele ser difícil.</p></article><article class="support-card"><span>PARCIALES</span><h3>Compará kilómetros</h3><p>Mirá estabilidad y tendencia, no sólo el mejor tramo. Desnivel y viento también importan.</p></article><article class="support-card"><span>OBJETIVO</span><h3>Convertí tiempo en ritmo</h3><p>Dividir la marca objetivo por la distancia da el promedio necesario, pero conviene planear un pequeño margen.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="shell faq"><div class="head"><div class="eyebrow">Preguntas frecuentes</div><h2>Lo importante, sin vueltas</h2></div><div class="faq-item open"><button class="faq-q">¿Pace y velocidad son lo mismo?<span>+</span></button><div class="faq-a">Describen el mismo movimiento de forma inversa: pace es tiempo por distancia; velocidad es distancia por hora.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">¿Cómo se proyectan otras distancias?<span>+</span></button><div class="faq-a">Se usa la relación entre distancia y tiempo con un exponente de resistencia. Es una referencia, no una promesa de marca.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">¿Sirve para caminar?<span>+</span></button><div class="faq-a">Sí. La conversión de tiempo, distancia, ritmo y velocidad funciona igual.</div></div></div></section>`} />
<script is:inline>
(()=>{const root=document.currentScript.previousElementSibling?.matches('.mockup-ritmo-pace')?document.currentScript.previousElementSibling:document.querySelector('.mockup-ritmo-pace');

(()=>{const $=id=>root.querySelector("#"+id),cases=["5 kilómetros","10 kilómetros","Media maratón","Maratón"],presets=[[5,0,27,30],[10,0,55,0],[21.097,2,3,0],[42.195,4,20,0]];let active=1;const n=id=>Math.max(0,Number($(id).value)||0),clock=sec=>{sec=Math.max(0,Math.round(sec));const h=Math.floor(sec/3600),m=Math.floor(sec%3600/60),s=sec%60;return h?`${h}:${String(m).padStart(2,"0")}:${String(s).padStart(2,"0")}`:`${m}:${String(s).padStart(2,"0")}`},pace=sec=>`${Math.floor(sec/60)}:${String(Math.round(sec%60)).padStart(2,"0")}`;function compute(){const distance=Math.max(.1,n("distance")),total=n("hours")*3600+n("minutes")*60+n("seconds"),unit=$("unit").value,unitDistance=unit==="mile"?1.609344:1,paceSeconds=total/distance*unitDistance,speed=total?distance/(total/3600):0,lap400=total/distance*.4,project=d=>total*Math.pow(d/distance,1.06),out=pace(paceSeconds)+(unit==="mile"?" /mi":" /km");$("amount").textContent=out;$("heroValue").textContent=out.replace(" ","");$("scenario").textContent=cases[active]||"Distancia personalizada";$("summary").textContent=`${clock(total)} para ${distance.toLocaleString("es-AR",{maximumFractionDigits:3})} km equivale a ${speed.toLocaleString("es-AR",{maximumFractionDigits:2})} km/h.`;$("m1").textContent=speed.toLocaleString("es-AR",{maximumFractionDigits:2})+" km/h";$("m2").textContent=clock(lap400);$("m3").textContent=clock(project(5));$("m4").textContent=clock(project(10));$("bar").style.width=Math.max(8,Math.min(96,speed/20*100))+"%"}function preset(i){active=i;const p=presets[i];["distance","hours","minutes","seconds"].forEach((id,j)=>$(id).value=p[j]);root.querySelectorAll("[data-case]").forEach((b,j)=>b.classList.toggle("active",i===j));compute()}root.querySelectorAll("[data-case]").forEach(b=>b.addEventListener("click",()=>preset(Number(b.dataset.case))));root.querySelectorAll("input,select").forEach(x=>x.addEventListener("input",()=>{const d=n("distance"),known=[5,10,21.097,42.195].findIndex(x=>Math.abs(x-d)<.001);active=known;root.querySelectorAll("[data-case]").forEach((b,j)=>b.classList.toggle("active",known===j));compute()}));$("calculate").addEventListener("click",compute);$("reset").addEventListener("click",()=>{$("unit").value="km";preset(1)});root.querySelectorAll(".faq-q").forEach(q=>q.addEventListener("click",()=>q.parentElement.classList.toggle("open")));compute()})();

})();
</script>
<style is:global>

.mockup-ritmo-pace{--ink:#182231;--muted:#657386;--blue:#174b7a;--blue2:#eaf4fb;--mint:#39b799;--mint2:#e7f8f3;--coral:#e77c67;--sun:#f4bd55;--line:#dce4e9;--paper:#fbfcfa;--white:#fff;--shadow:0 18px 48px rgba(23,75,122,.1)}.mockup-ritmo-pace *{box-sizing:border-box}.mockup-ritmo-pace{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif}.mockup-ritmo-pace button,.mockup-ritmo-pace input,.mockup-ritmo-pace select{font:inherit}.mockup-ritmo-pace .shell{max-width:1180px;margin:auto;padding:0 24px}.mockup-ritmo-pace .header{height:76px;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;align-items:center}.mockup-ritmo-pace .nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}.mockup-ritmo-pace .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-weight:900}.mockup-ritmo-pace .logo{width:31px;height:35px;border-radius:7px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:12px}.mockup-ritmo-pace .links{display:flex;gap:24px;color:#526074;font-size:13px;font-weight:750}.mockup-ritmo-pace .navbtn{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:9px 12px;color:#46566a}.mockup-ritmo-pace .hero{padding:52px 0 47px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eef9f6,#fff7e7 58%,#edf6fb)}.mockup-ritmo-pace .hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.08fr .92fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}.mockup-ritmo-pace .crumb{color:var(--blue);font-size:13px;font-weight:800}.mockup-ritmo-pace .eyebrow{text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.13em;font-size:11px;font-weight:900;color:var(--blue);margin-top:18px}.mockup-ritmo-pace .hero h1{font-size:52px;line-height:1.03;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:12px 0 17px}.mockup-ritmo-pace .lede{font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;color:#536174}.mockup-ritmo-pace .chips{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:22px}.mockup-ritmo-pace .chip{background:#fff;border:1px solid #d4e2df;border-radius:99px;padding:8px 11px;font-size:11px;color:#46655e;font-weight:800}.mockup-ritmo-pace .art{height:310px;position:relative}.mockup-ritmo-pace .orb{position:absolute;width:265px;height:265px;border-radius:50%;right:35px;top:18px;background:#dceef2}.mockup-ritmo-pace .card-art{position:absolute;left:20px;top:64px;width:250px;height:164px;border-radius:23px;background:#fff;border:3px solid var(--blue);box-shadow:14px 16px 0 rgba(57,183,153,.22);padding:25px}.mockup-ritmo-pace .art-tag{font-size:10px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.08em}.mockup-ritmo-pace .art-value{font-size:37px;font-weight:950;color:var(--blue);margin:17px 0}.mockup-ritmo-pace .art-line{height:9px;border-radius:9px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--mint) 0 67%,#e5ebee 67%)}.mockup-ritmo-pace .section{padding:62px 0}.mockup-ritmo-pace .head{text-align:center;max-width:790px;margin:0 auto 29px}.mockup-ritmo-pace .head h2{font-size:36px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:8px 0}.mockup-ritmo-pace .head p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}.mockup-ritmo-pace .cases{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:11px;margin-bottom:22px}.mockup-ritmo-pace .case{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:17px;padding:16px;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink);min-height:108px}.mockup-ritmo-pace .case.active{border:2px solid var(--blue);background:var(--blue2)}.mockup-ritmo-pace .case b{display:block;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:6px}.mockup-ritmo-pace .case small{color:var(--muted);font-size:10px;line-height:1.4}.mockup-ritmo-pace .calc{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.1fr;gap:22px;align-items:start}.mockup-ritmo-pace .panel{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:23px;padding:27px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}.mockup-ritmo-pace .panel h3{font-size:21px;margin:0 0 7px}.mockup-ritmo-pace .intro{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5;margin:0 0 20px}.mockup-ritmo-pace .fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:13px}.mockup-ritmo-pace .field.full{grid-column:1/-1}.mockup-ritmo-pace .field label{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:850;margin-bottom:7px}.mockup-ritmo-pace .field input,.mockup-ritmo-pace .field select{width:100%;height:48px;border:1px solid #cbd5df;border-radius:12px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink);padding:0 12px;outline:none}.mockup-ritmo-pace .field input:focus,.mockup-ritmo-pace .field select:focus{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(23,75,122,.12)}.mockup-ritmo-pace .buttons{display:flex;gap:9px;margin-top:20px}.mockup-ritmo-pace .primary,.mockup-ritmo-pace .secondary{border-radius:12px;padding:13px 16px;font-weight:900;cursor:pointer}.mockup-ritmo-pace .primary{border:1px solid var(--blue);background:var(--blue);color:#fff;flex:1}.mockup-ritmo-pace .secondary{border:1px solid #ccd6df;background:#fff;color:#47576b}.mockup-ritmo-pace .result{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#174b7a,#287b9b);color:#fff}.mockup-ritmo-pace .result .intro{color:#d8eaf2}.mockup-ritmo-pace .res-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}.mockup-ritmo-pace .label{font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#c6e3ed;font-weight:900}.mockup-ritmo-pace .amount{font-size:42px;font-weight:950;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:9px 0}.mockup-ritmo-pace .pill{height:max-content;background:#e5faf3;color:#155e4e;border-radius:99px;padding:8px 10px;font-size:10px;font-weight:900}.mockup-ritmo-pace .summary{font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:#eff7f9}.mockup-ritmo-pace .metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:9px;margin-top:17px}.mockup-ritmo-pace .metric{border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.23);background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:14px;padding:14px}.mockup-ritmo-pace .metric span{display:block;color:#d3e7ee;font-size:10px}.mockup-ritmo-pace .metric strong{display:block;color:#fff;font-size:18px;margin-top:4px}.mockup-ritmo-pace .progress{height:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.18);border-radius:99px;overflow:hidden;margin-top:18px}.mockup-ritmo-pace .progress i{display:block;height:100%;width:68%;background:var(--sun);border-radius:99px;transition:.25s}.mockup-ritmo-pace .note{margin-top:14px;background:#fff2d7;color:#684817;border-radius:12px;padding:11px 13px;font-size:11px;font-weight:750}.mockup-ritmo-pace .support{background:#f1f7f5}.mockup-ritmo-pace .support-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:13px}.mockup-ritmo-pace .support-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:20px}.mockup-ritmo-pace .support-card span{display:inline-block;background:var(--mint2);color:#176d5b;border-radius:8px;padding:5px 7px;font-size:9px;font-weight:900}.mockup-ritmo-pace .support-card h3{font-size:15px;margin:11px 0 6px}.mockup-ritmo-pace .support-card p{font-size:11px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--muted);margin:0}.mockup-ritmo-pace .faq{max-width:850px;margin:auto}.mockup-ritmo-pace .faq-item{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.mockup-ritmo-pace .faq-q{width:100%;border:0;background:transparent;color:var(--ink);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;text-align:left;padding:19px 3px;font-weight:850;cursor:pointer}.mockup-ritmo-pace .faq-a{display:none;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6;padding:0 35px 18px 3px}.mockup-ritmo-pace .faq-item.open .faq-a{display:block}.mockup-ritmo-pace .footer{height:100px;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}@media(max-width:900px){.mockup-ritmo-pace .links{display:none}.mockup-ritmo-pace .hero-grid,.mockup-ritmo-pace .calc{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mockup-ritmo-pace .cases{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.mockup-ritmo-pace .support-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mockup-ritmo-pace .hero h1{font-size:43px}}@media(max-width:560px){.mockup-ritmo-pace .shell{padding:0 16px}.mockup-ritmo-pace .hero h1{font-size:35px}.mockup-ritmo-pace .art{display:none}.mockup-ritmo-pace .cases,.mockup-ritmo-pace .fields,.mockup-ritmo-pace .metrics{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mockup-ritmo-pace .panel{padding:21px}.mockup-ritmo-pace .res-top{display:block}.mockup-ritmo-pace .pill{display:inline-block;margin-top:8px}}

.mockup-ritmo-pace { width:100%; overflow:hidden; }
.mockup-ritmo-pace .top, .mockup-ritmo-pace header.top { display:none !important; }
.mockup-ritmo-pace .foot { display:none !important; }
.mockup-ritmo-pace .support-real { width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 40px)); margin:auto; padding:64px 0; }
.mockup-ritmo-pace .support-real-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr; gap:30px; }
.mockup-ritmo-pace .support-real details { border-bottom:1px solid #dfe6ed; padding:14px 0; }
.mockup-ritmo-pace .support-real summary { cursor:pointer; font-weight:750; }
.mockup-ritmo-pace .support-real p { color:#52657b; line-height:1.65; }
/* Prevent the legacy site's global typography palette from overriding text
   designed to inherit a light color inside dark mockup surfaces. */
.mockup-ritmo-pace :where(h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6,p,span,strong,b,small,em,i,a,label,button,summary,li,th,td) { color:inherit; }
.mockup-ritmo-pace input[type="number"] { -moz-appearance:textfield; appearance:textfield; }
.mockup-ritmo-pace input[type="number"]::-webkit-inner-spin-button, .mockup-ritmo-pace input[type="number"]::-webkit-outer-spin-button { -webkit-appearance:none; margin:0; }
@media(max-width:800px){.mockup-ritmo-pace .support-real-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
{data && <section class="mockup-ritmo-pace support-real"><div class="support-real-grid"><div><h2>Preguntas frecuentes</h2>{data.faq?.map((f:any,i:number)=><details open={i===0}><summary>{f.q}</summary><p set:html={f.a}/></details>)}</div><div><h2>Fuentes</h2>{data.sources?.map((s:any)=><a href={s.url} target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">{s.name}</a>)}</div></div></section>}
